massage therapy in chronic disease: a 4-year prospective cohort study</article-title><source>J Altern Complement Med</source><year>2007</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>635</fpage><lpage>642</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17718646</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1089/acm.2006.6345</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bussing</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Ostermann</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Majorek</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Matthiessen</surname><given-names>PF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Eurythmy Therapy in clinical studies: a systematic literature review</article-title><source>BMC Complement Altern Med</source><year>2008</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>8</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18377647</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1472-6882-8-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Steiner</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><source>Geisteswissenschaft und Medizin</source><year>1985</year><publisher-name>Dornach: Rudolf Steiner Verlag</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Junge</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>So entstand das &#x000d6;ldispersionsbad</article-title><source>Der Merkurstab</source><year>1990</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>338</fpage><lpage>339</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Buchholz</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Uhlmann</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Sitzmann F</surname></name></perso